and if I CTRL+C there I it hangs attempting to start dhcpcd.


I have attached a full log of the problem as well.  I'm currently
running 3.9.11 but intend to upgrade to current code soon so if this
is something that has been over come by more recent kernels let me
know.

Also I am aware of the ram on this box being half disabled.. I think
there are some weak solder joints on the RAM or Mainboard... as it
works properly after it has been in a warm room for awhile.

Hopefully this is of interest! I've noticed a few people from time to
